---
layout: base.njk
title: Hot Mess Hobby Shop — Where Chaos Meets Creativity
description: Hot Mess Hobby Shop is one LLC, several obsessions — tropical enclosed terrariums, football cards, and whatever's next.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Where chaos meets creativity.</h1>
    <p class="lead"> Here at the Hot Mess Hobby Shop we care deeply about caring deeply. Have you a passion? You are welcome here. Lets get messy. </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      {%- for venture in ventures %}
      <a href="{{ venture.slug }}.html" class="btn{% if not loop.first %} btn-outline{% endif %}">{{ venture.homeCta }}</a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title text-center">Whats messy right now?</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Dive deeper into the chaos. </p>

    {% for venture in ventures %}
    <div class="venture">
      <div class="venture-media">
        <img src="images/{{ venture.image }}" alt="{{ venture.name }} illustration">
      </div>
      <div class="venture-copy">
        <span class="card-tag">{{ venture.navLabel }}</span>
        <h3>{{ venture.homeHeading }}</h3>
        <p>{{ venture.homeDescription }}</p>
        <a href="{{ venture.slug }}.html" class="btn">{{ venture.homeCta }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="coming-soon">
      <h2>More Hobbies Coming Soon</h2>
      <p>The hot mess is built to grow up, down, sideways, and probably in circles - and thats exactly how we'd like it. Lets get messy.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
